{'symbol': 'WMT', 'date': '2021-12-21 06:00:00', 'title': 'VERIFIQUE™ LAUNCHES ON WALMART MARKETPLACE', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, DEC. 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- VERITEQUE USA, INC. IS ANNOUNCING THE LAUNCH OF THE VERIFIQUE BRAND ON WALMART MARKETPLACE IN THE UNITED STATES, AS A NEWLY REGISTERED SELLER ON THE PLATFORM. VERIFIQUE HAS LISTED BOTH OF THEIR FLAGSHIP MADE IN THE USA PRODUCTS ON THE PLATFORM, THE VERIFIQUE CANNABIS DETECTION TEST, AND THE VERIFIQUE FENTANYL+ DETECTION TEST.'}